{"4124640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "B.I.D.", "steam_appid": 4124640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >B.I.D. - Boss in Diapers is a fun multiplayer card game. 2-4 players fight to decide who rules the daycare. The goal is simple: Outsmart your friends and claim the Boss Chair!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers a unique take on classic card games with a baby-mafia twist:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B.I.D.</strong>: The main mode. Use strategy, make offers, and bluff to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baby Bluff:</strong> A fast and risky battle. Lying is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More chaos is coming soon!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/5407842b2d98de378c92a91d6abea521.poster.avif?t=1787830614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/5407842b2d98de378c92a91d6abea521.webm?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/5407842b2d98de378c92a91d6abea521.mp4?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Create Your Baby Mafia Boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your little mafia boss with tiny suits, pacifiers, fedoras, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your high chair with accessories and toys!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/8745efa99eacb72a7c8769b16e91969d.poster.avif?t=1787830614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/8745efa99eacb72a7c8769b16e91969d.webm?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/8745efa99eacb72a7c8769b16e91969d.mp4?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>The Teacher</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match happens in a colorful classroom. It looks innocent, but chaos is coming. Don't make the Teacher mad!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/484adcc8d5781714645224823029754c.poster.avif?t=1787830614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/484adcc8d5781714645224823029754c.webm?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/484adcc8d5781714645224823029754c.mp4?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Play With Friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play online with 2-4 players. Trick your rivals, laugh together, and claim the Boss Chair!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/93d2bf0a6f156854c20f5f7152038123.poster.avif?t=1787830614\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/93d2bf0a6f156854c20f5f7152038123.webm?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4124640/extras/93d2bf0a6f156854c20f5f7152038123.mp4?t=1787830614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\